                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg1181">p. 1181</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d666-f2" n="2" xml:id="d666-f2-content">
                <p>The reference here is to an article circulated by the Soviet news agency Tass on
                    September 26 which attributed the breakdown of the Berlin negotiations to the
                    Western Powers.</p>
            </note>
